## File Structure

```
src/partners/
├── PartnerBehavior.ts           # Interface definition
├── DefaultPartnerBehavior.ts    # Base implementation with sensible defaults
├── partnerRegistry.ts           # Map + factory function
├── EmberPartnerBehavior.ts
├── GamerSaloonPartnerBehavior.ts
├── SparketPartnerBehavior.ts
